content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Designer",
      "description": "Person creating clothing concepts and related materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Clothing Concept",
      "description": "Initial design idea for a potential garment."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sample Production",
      "description": "Small production run of a concept using selected fabrics."
    },
    {
      "name": "Fabric",
      "description": "Material chosen for producing sample pieces."
    },
    {
      "name": "Collection",
      "description": "Set of finalized pieces prepared for a season or release."
    },
    {
      "name": "Piece",
      "description": "Individual garment derived from a clothing concept."
    },
    {
      "name": "Campaign Outline",
      "description": "Initial structure of the marketing campaign for a collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Production Manager",
      "description": "Person estimating and approving production-related work."
    },
    {
      "name": "Effort Estimate",
      "description": "Assessment of materials and work needed for a concept."
    },
    {
      "name": "Marketing Manager",
      "description": "Person planning and coordinating marketing activities."
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Product Media",
      "description": "Images or media files used for promotional content."
    },
    {
      "name": "Retail Buyer",
      "description": "Person selecting and ordering pieces for retail stores."
    },
    {
      "name": "Retail Order",
      "description": "Order placed by a retail buyer for specific pieces with delivery dates."
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Date",
      "description": "Confirmed date for delivering ordered pieces."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Input from the retail buyer regarding the pieces or collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Manufacturing Officer",
      "description": "Person coordinating production and handling manufacturing requests."
    },
    {
      "name": "Production Order",
      "description": "Instruction to manufacture items in a collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Manufacturer",
      "description": "Entity responsible for producing physical garments."
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Designer",
      "to": "Clothing Concept",
      "description": "Designer creates the Clothing Concept."
    },
    {
      "from": "Designer",
      "to": "Sample Production",
      "description": "Designer initiates Sample Production."
    },
    {
      "from": "Production Manager",
      "to": "Clothing Concept",
      "description": "Production Manager reviews the Clothing Concept."
    },
    {
      "from": "Production Manager",
      "to": "Sample Production",
      "description": "Production Manager approves the Sample Production."
    },
    {
      "from": "Production Manager",
      "to": "Effort Estimate",
      "description": "Production Manager produces the Effort Estimate."
    },
    {
      "from": "Production Manager",
      "to": "Collection",
      "description": "Production Manager adds a Piece to the Collection."
    },
    {
      "from": "Marketing Manager",
      "to": "Campaign Outline",
      "description": "Marketing Manager creates the Campaign Outline."
    },
    {
      "from": "Marketing Manager",
      "to": "Final Product Media",
      "description": "Marketing Manager requests Final Product Media."
    },
    {
      "from": "Designer",
      "to": "Final Product Media",
      "description": "Designer provides the Final Product Media."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manufacturing Officer",
      "to": "Production Order",
      "description": "Manufacturing Officer issues the Production Order."
    },
    {
      "from": "Production Order",
      "to": "Manufacturer",
      "description": "Production Order is sent to the Manufacturer."
    },
    {
      "from": "Retail Buyer",
      "to": "Collection",
      "description": "Retail Buyer reviews the Collection."
    },
    {
      "from": "Retail Buyer",
      "to": "Retail Order",
      "description": "Retail Buyer creates the Retail Order."
    },
    {
      "from": "Manufacturing Officer",
      "to": "Retail Order",
      "description": "Manufacturing Officer receives the Retail Order."
    },
    {
      "from": "Retail Order",
      "to": "Feedback",
      "description": "Retail Order leads to generated Feedback."
    },
    {
      "from": "Designer",
      "to": "Feedback",
      "description": "Designer reviews the Feedback."
    }
  ]
}
```
